  "details": "Description\n\nWhen the left side menu is minimized, the world search and current world location icons are uniminized after switching to another tab and returning back to the world tab. This makes them overlapping in the UI \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nGo to the world tab and minimize the side menu. Then go to another tab and return back. The Search/Current World icons should be unminimized and are overlapping the other parts of the UI\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
